Key Takeaway
This initiative is a strong candidate for a phased modernization approach:
Phase 1: Automate the existing SQL/Alteryx workflow and integrate directly with Pega, eliminating manual processing and Excel-based deduplication.
Phase 2: Introduce an AI-driven escalation detection engine that expands beyond the current highly filtered rules-based population and proactively identifies additional patients at risk of escalation.
